Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:06.03,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,"G" is for the Green Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:09.11,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,Withering in the hot sunlight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:11.66,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,"W" is for the Water Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:14.51,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,Boiled away by fire torture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:17.16,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,"S" is for the Stone Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:20.29,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,Hammered into little pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:22.80,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,"E" is for the Eastern Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.92,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,Who fell into a pit so bye-bye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.48,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,"B" is for the Beast Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:31.34,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,Who was terrified one day by a sharp spear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.36,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,"C" is for the Champignon Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:35.89,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,Poison doesn't bother her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.25,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,She's the really scary one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.93,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,'Cause she's gonna bring \NThe End of All Things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:43.83,Italics,Kids,0,0,0,,There are lots of devils. \NDrive them all away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:46.15,Default,Blonde Kid,0,0,0,,Yes! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:51.55,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 9: THE HOUSE IN THE BLACK FOREST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:52.03,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Kids from the village. The\N adults tell them to stay away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:56.62,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,but sometimes they come to play \Nthis close to the forest anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:01:00.28,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.00,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,End of All Things?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:06.81,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Don't let that stuff get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:45.78,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I was told I need to find great happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.27,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,but sometimes I'm consumed\N by such an intense sadness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.81,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I can't put it down in my diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:02:59.41,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,How would you handle something \Nlike that, Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:04.28,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I know it sounded immature and corny, \Nbut I worked up the courage to ask anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:18.82,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I try to remember something sad that \NI keep locked up inside, cry over it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:22.30,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,and use those tears as a bed\N to grow more mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:25.36,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Then I make tea with those tear mushrooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:28.82,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,drink it, and cry more to detox.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:32.01,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,It really helps me calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:35.40,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Then I use the tears I cried \Nto make more mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.91,0:03:39.94,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,She responded with an off-kilter \Nbut very practical answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:42.57,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's caffeine-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:45.32,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,That's not really the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.20,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Would you like to watch me make the tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:51.43,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I don't know why she \Nsuddenly seemed so eager,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:55.26,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,but I got the strong impression \Nthat I shouldn't say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:12.25,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Wow! It smells nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:18.36,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But I've never smelled anything \Nlike it. A very unique smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:24.13,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It was lush but delicate, and made me\N imagine floating in a warm ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:25.33,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,A very mellow fragrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:27.37,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:30.27,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I did extract all of the poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:33.12,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,but don't force yourself \Nif you think it's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:38.03,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,As Miss Witch nervously stammered her \Ninsistence she'd removed all the poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:40.00,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I thought she looked kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:41.63,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,But, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:48.97,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,The tears these mushrooms grew from, \Nthey were part of Miss Witch's body...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:51.39,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Why's he suddenly look so intense?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:54.21,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You'd better not be thinking \Nsomething dirty, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.55,0:04:55.93,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Back off, crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:05:00.57,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Wow! This smells delicious! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:08.61,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:16.86,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:22.62,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I had so many tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:30.55,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,There was enough sadness and pain \Ninside me to fill up a whole cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:39.02,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I didn't lose the memories \Nthe sadness had been linked to,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.18,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,and the mushrooms that came from my tears
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:48.46,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,looked like emerald mixed into a sky blue.\N They had a deep, very lovely color.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.90,0:05:53.75,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,Miss Witch took them, sliced them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:56.26,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,dried them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:00.12,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,fried them to remove the poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.70,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,and boiled out the memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:07.35,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,By the time the tea from \Nmy tear mushrooms was ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:12.26,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,my heart felt almost as unbelievably \Nsunny and clear as the blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:19.94,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,It's up to you to decide \Nwhen you should drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:23.44,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Don't forget to collect the tears\N you cry in a cup, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:29.20,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,It was a very well-polished tear ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:32.45,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,There were jars of Miss Witch's tear tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:38.06,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,It must have taken many nights of feeling \Nvery sad to have made so much tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:42.71,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I wonder just how many nights \NMiss Witch had felt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.58,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I wonder how many days \Nshe's spent like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:49.72,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,quietly enduring the \Nembrace of such sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:52.86,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I also made some tea \Nto help you sleep, Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:54.97,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:07:01.62,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,I would start to wonder about that \Nduring our tear mushroom tea parties
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:04.15,Italics,Lize (N),0,0,0,,so they always left me \Nfeeling a little melancholy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:05.65,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:17.28,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, Luna. Did you accidentally \Ngive the crow tear tea, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:19.29,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,If he realizes, he'll kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.17,Italics,Merino (M),0,0,0,,I didn't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:27.17,Italics,Minos (M),0,0,0,,Gosh, I didn't know the crow \Nhad any tears inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:29.92,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:30.91,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Caw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.93,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Caw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:55.11,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:59.31,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Good. He's getting serious about studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:04.83,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,What is going on here? What \Nare these two people doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:07.75,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:11.23,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,It says something about a "kiss,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:15.97,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,but why would these people \Nbe doing something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:20.27,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Is this brat for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:26.20,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, are you all right, Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:28.79,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you, Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:31.59,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:34.46,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Would he really lose his memories \Nabout something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:38.97,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,A kiss is something people \Ndo when they're very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:42.61,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,A sign of intimacy,\Nkind of like a greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:48.39,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Have you ever kissed someone \Nbefore, Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.71,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Man, he's aggressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:54.75,Italics,Minos (M),0,0,0,,She froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:56.55,Italics,Merino (M),0,0,0,,She's not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:58.62,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,She's malfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:04.57,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Exactly how close do people \Nhave to be in order to kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:09.31,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Does our relationship count as \Nbeing that close, Miss Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:12.82,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,This little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:18.07,Italics,Old Woman Wind N,0,0,0,,{\pos(333.143,292.286)}He shall cloak himself in \Na semblance of innocence...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:18.53,Default - Top,Lize,0,0,0,,Or does the relationship \Nbetween you and I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:21.80,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,not really count as that close?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:24.41,Italics,Claude (N),0,0,0,,At that moment, the crow thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:28.67,Italics,Claude (N),0,0,0,,"I'll be damned. I guess that's \None way to try to steal a kiss."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:32.73,Italics,Claude (N),0,0,0,,Excerpted from the memoirs \Nof Claude the crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:39.65,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Th-That definition of a kiss \Napplies to normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:44.41,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,It doesn't apply to someone \Nwith a poison body like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.85,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,That's a pretty decent comeback for Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.69,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:54.53,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,that even if we have to do \Nit through a magic cloth,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:57.70,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I would like to kiss you, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:09:59.91,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:02.66,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,This brat never gives up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:18.14,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Even strangers kiss each other's hands.\N I heard that's just being polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:21.93,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Give it a rest, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:39.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I hope that someday you let me \Nplace one on your lips, Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:44.70,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to go practice my magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:47.95,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:54.71,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That brat. He knew exactly how to give \Na formal kiss on the hand, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:11:03.22,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,The nerve of that little white witch punk!\N You don't know what a kiss is, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:05.22,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That whole damn thing was an act!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:09.20,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Miss Witch was so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:15.23,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Today I feel like I'll be able to do the \Nhard magic I struggled with in training!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:21.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It feels like my heart's sprouted wings.\N It feels like I can do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.67,0:11:24.49,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Shopping in the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:26.24,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,You really want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:29.27,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'll be doing us a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.59,0:11:34.13,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,and it'll also give us a way to evaluate \Nyour magic progress. A preliminary test.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:35.90,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,And he'll keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.07,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:41.38,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Luna is always protecting you \Nso maybe you didn't realize,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:44.68,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,but a kid like you who can't \Nreally handle his magic yet
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:47.87,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,is an easy target for all sorts \Nof demons and poison creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.72,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll see some \Nonce you're out of the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:52.91,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,and outside of Luna's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:56.12,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Demons and poison creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:12:00.55,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Use the magic you've learned so far \Nto protect yourself and the bull
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:02.20,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,and complete the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:06.06,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If you can't pull that much off, well, \Nyou'd be abandoned anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:10.17,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Or if you're chicken and \Nwould rather be babysat here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:13.25,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,while you play house in your wee \Nlittle garden, then suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:18.71,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you one thing. You sure \Nas hell better not try to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:22.98,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If you do run, I'll turn \Nthat guy into stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:25.97,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Crows sure do love their stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:29.11,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,"Babysat" by Luna and "playing house"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:35.48,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'll go. I won't try to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:40.23,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I will complete the job safely \Nand return to this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.19,0:12:47.95,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,"BEEF STEW"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:45.33,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,So he's basically just running errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.95,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:52.20,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You've got nothing to worry \Nabout with me by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:55.83,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Once we clear those two hills, \Nwe'll be in Musher Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:56.96,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:13:00.41,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,But you know, if I did \Nget turned into stew,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:05.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,it'd probably be the most delicious stew \Nin the world. Don't you think so, Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:07.22,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:12.47,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,But I still don't want to get eaten,\N so you better not run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:17.96,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Minos, we'll have time to eat \Nlunch later. Let's keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:23.99,Italics,Minos,0,0,0,,I want some of that grass over there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:26.01,Italics,Lize,0,0,0,,Minos, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:30.49,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Looks like tonight's dinner will \Nbe rotten beef stew after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:33.50,Italics,Lize,0,0,0,,"Minos! Return!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:40.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, let's hurry to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:44.01,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I can smell some really tasty \Ngrass along the road ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:47.61,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What the hell did he just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:50.59,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Did he use spirit language for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:57.88,Default,Tree Spirit,0,0,0,,Lize, I offer you the \Nblessing of the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:13:59.52,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:08.12,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:13.91,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,It's a poison creature, so be careful. \NDon't get too close, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:16.16,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Poison creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.23,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:22.15,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Living creatures that have ingested \Ntoo much of the world's poisons
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:26.03,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,and were completely poisoned... \Nand transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.98,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Some of them are turned into one\N by other poison creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:36.18,Flashback,Luna,0,0,0,,Those fellows aren't demons, though. \NBut you've got to learn the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:38.44,Flashback_Italics,Luna,0,0,0,,Be careful, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.35,0:14:42.01,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I don't think this guy \Nis gonna do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:45.08,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Just don't step in his \Npoisonous slime, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:48.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,He must be in a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:50.96,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,If Luna was here, she could \Nhave absorbed his poison
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:54.33,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,and made him a little more \Ncomfortable, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:59.70,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,When Miss Witch encounters poison \Ncreatures, does she absorb their poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:01.83,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Only enough to give them a little relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:06.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,She used to sprinkle \Npoison-sucking spores on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:13.35,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,but that made the mushrooms grow too big, \Neven though it did take away the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:16.19,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,So now she puts a sheet on \Nthem that absorbs the poison
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.95,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,and keeps the miasma \Nfrom spreading around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:25.61,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh, look. Those guys are wearing \Nsheets that Luna gave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:31.07,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh? What now? You have a friend \Nback there who wants a sheet, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:33.87,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:40.62,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Sorry guys, but Luna isn't here today. \NShe'll come by again, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.75,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,How do the sheets fit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:45.03,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Miss Witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:48.38,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Just right? Good! I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.60,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I'll tell Luna you said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:59.90,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:07.31,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch really is a wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:12.40,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Well, of course she is. \NAll of us are just crazy about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:14.87,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna's an incredible witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:19.37,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm crazy about her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:24.19,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Someday, I want to become \Na wonderful magician just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:27.92,Italics,Minos,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I'm sure you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:31.67,Italics,Minos,0,0,0,,It makes me really happy \Nthat you like Luna too, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:39.43,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to support her. I want to give \Nher strength and bring her happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:43.75,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to be at least a small \Nsource of joy in her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:47.67,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and get the goats \Nso we can go home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:52.03,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I'll go wherever I have to \Nin order to be there for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.36,0:16:55.03,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Look, Lize. There's the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:21.06,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,We finished our shopping \Nin no time. Nice job, Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:29.27,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Everyone was so friendly with you. \NThey did seem a little nervous, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:35.82,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I've never had such an easy time \Nshopping before. What a difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:38.45,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Now we just have to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:46.98,Default,Lize/Minos,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:51.90,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, the rain's poisonous, \Nso remember what Luna told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:56.59,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Pull up your hood, cover your skin,\N and don't forget your gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:18:00.60,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Also, put the magic sheets \Nwe brought on the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.44,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,What about you, Minos?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:04.82,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:05.75,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:07.10,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:18.78,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,That's a poison creature! \NWhat should we do, Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.21,0:18:23.15,Flashback_Italics,Spirit Voice,0,0,0,,Lize, I shall give you \Nthree wishing seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:27.21,Flashback_Italics,Spirit Voice,0,0,0,,If there's a power you want to use \Nor a desire you wish fulfilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:32.82,Flashback_Italics,Spirit Voice,0,0,0,,eat one of these and concentrate. \NIt will amplify your magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:35.72,Flashback_Italics,Spirit Voice,0,0,0,,and grant any wish within our power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.18,Flashback_Italics,Spirit Voice,0,0,0,,Now, recite your true name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:46.39,Default,Claude/Luna,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:50.14,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What is this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:54.89,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, I think he's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:58.78,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,The goat is in danger, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:02.15,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Please, loosen it and let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:06.02,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I don't like this. \NI really don't like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:14.79,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,A huge flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:19.80,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,The goat got scratched by the poison\N claws but it's still alive, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:23.98,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,That was wild, Lize! When did \Nyou learn that kind of magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:27.59,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:32.95,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Why did you waste wishing seeds \Nto save a creature like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:38.60,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,Poison monsters like that harm us. \NWe hoped you'd eliminate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:48.15,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Are you in pain from the poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.07,0:19:52.79,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Were you after the magical \Nsheet the goat was wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:59.54,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,We don't have enough \Nfabric to give him one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:04.04,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,We need the goat's sheet \Nto bandage its wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:09.87,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,Lize, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:17.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:23.07,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,You used conjuring magic? You even \Nconjured one of Luna's magic sheets?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:27.31,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Lize! \NYou've gotten so much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:29.33,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:40.09,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh, good. It fits perfectly. \NThat sheet is yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:43.59,Default,Green Spirit 1,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:48.21,Default,Green Spirit 2,0,0,0,,How could you use the power we lent \Nyou to help such an abomination?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.08,Default,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:53.60,Default,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,I don't wanna talk to you.\N Think about what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.65,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm going to learn magic on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:02.07,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Thank you for the powers \Nyou gave me until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:05.66,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,But you're okay. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:08.94,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Just stop trying to \Nsteal sheets from others,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.86,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,and hurry on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:15.03,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm heading home now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:18.76,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:21.63,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Minos, can you carry this goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:26.26,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,We need Miss Witch to treat \Nthe poison wounds immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:29.66,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:34.30,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, can you walk? \NDo you want to ride, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:38.65,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,No. I want to walk on my own two feet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:41.78,Italics,Lize,0,0,0,,to go back to Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:49.31,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I'm sure Miss Witch is \Nwaiting for us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:53.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Everyone in the black \Nforest is waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:21:57.19,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And I'm anxious to return to that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:00.81,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I feel like I've finally found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:04.46,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,a place that I can call home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:21.55,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna, can you treat this goat's poison \Nwith your mushrooms right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:23.39,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:25.93,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,See, aren't you glad I went with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:27.48,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:31.40,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Yeah, he would have been \Nin big trouble without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.69,0:22:33.45,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:38.17,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:41.42,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:46.17,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.61,0:24:10.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: REUNION
